      <Description>$MISSILEGUIDANCE_MODE_CRUISE - &lt;color=#D3D11F&gt;$MISSILESEEKER_MODE_COMMAND_ABBREV&lt;/color&gt;/$MISSILESEEKER_MODE_ARAD_HOJ_ABBREV(&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;RADAR&lt;/color&gt;) - $MISSILEWARHEAD_SHORT_HEIMPACT</Description>
      <LongDescription>The &lt;noparse&gt;SGM-H-300 Atlatl 1&lt;/noparse&gt; is a size 3 waypoint-capable cruise missile.  It is based on the SGM-H-3 body, which is a high speed hybrid missile designed to strike heavy targets.  This missile will deliver a Contact Fuze, High Explosive, Shaped warhead.  It homes in on its target using command guidance from its launching ship.  If the primary seeker does not find a target or is jammed, it can fall back on a Radar Home-on-Jam seeker.

